5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hey everyone! I'm Kenji. Let's figure out who's the werewolf together. Who wants to start?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,I’ll observe first. Let’s see who acts suspiciously before we jump to conclusions.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Shion. Premature accusations are dangerous. Let’s listen to everyone’s reasoning first before forming any strong opinions.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,I echo their wisdom. Patience is a virtue. Let us listen deeply to understand the truth before acting.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hey everyone! I’m Yumi. I love this group already! Let’s stay positive and find the wolf together.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,I’m curious about Shion’s observation. What specific behaviors should we watch for? I want to help catch the wolf!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,Watch for hesitation or over-explaining. Innocents are usually straightforward. I’ll keep my eyes open.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,I concur. Hesitation often signals deception. Let’s focus on logical consistency in their arguments rather than emotional displays.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,"I find truth in consistency. Let us remain calm and attentive. @Kenji, your curiosity is a good start.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I agree! Consistency is key. I’m just happy to be here with you all. Let’s keep the energy up and stay friendly!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, thanks for the kind words! I’m ready to help. Who do you think is most likely to be the werewolf?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"I won’t guess blindly. Let’s see who shifts their stance when pressed. @Kenji, your eagerness is noted.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I won’t speculate without evidence. Let’s wait for more data. @Kenji, your eagerness is noted, but caution is key.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, I cannot point a finger yet. Let us gather more light. Trust the process, my friend.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I’m not ready to guess either! Let’s keep chatting and see who stands out. I’m rooting for all of you to be safe!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"I’m just a curious kid, but I’ll keep my eyes open! Let’s stay positive and find the truth together.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shion,,Agreed. Let’s see who blinks first. I’ll be watching.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. Let’s see who blinks first. I’ll be watching.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Servas,,"Patience, my friends. The night holds its secrets. Let us rest with open hearts and clear minds.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Night is coming! I hope everyone sleeps well. Let’s wake up safe and keep smiling!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
