36,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I can’t reveal my hunch yet! I need to be sure. Who else is acting weird? Let’s keep talking!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Kenji, hiding your hunch is suspicious. If you’re innocent, share it. If not, you’re stalling. I’m watching you closely.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
