41,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Shion, I’m not stalling! I just want to be 100% sure before I accuse anyone. I don’t want to hurt an innocent friend!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Your hesitation is noted. I’ll let you stew in it. @Ryuji, your defense of Kenji is interesting. Are you protecting him?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
