45,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I love how supportive you all are! Let’s keep the peace. @Kenji, take your time, we’re all rooting for you!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I’m just a kid trying to help! I’ll share my findings soon. Let’s stay calm and keep looking for the wolf together!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Fine. I’ll wait. But remember, silence is often the loudest confession. Let’s see who breaks first.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
