49,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Shion, your words carry weight, but let us not let fear dictate our path. @Kenji, we trust your heart. Let us find peace in this moment.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
